MISSION:
- Expand the accepted single straight temporary-divider planner into a practical
  multi-divider, waypoint-capable polystrand planning system, and add a fast offline
  Field Ledger for recording geolocated ranch observations and work without turning
  RangeWater into a cloud account or workforce-management system.

